No Minecraft assets are included.

The WebAssembly build links Falcon Protocol, Falcon NBT, and portable sources
from Falcon Network. These components are licensed under LGPL-3.0 and their
accompanying GPL-3.0 terms. Dependency revisions are pinned in
cmake/Dependencies.cmake. Their license texts and source/relinking instructions
are distributed with the web build under third-party/.

HTTP endpoint transport detection follows the behavior inspected in SolarProxy:
probe GET /v1/join before falling back to RakNet. No SolarProxy source is copied.

Kestrel was inspected as an architectural reference; its sources are not
included in this implementation.
